---
layout: main
title: Oefeningen vrijdagtraining
subtitle: Inspiratie voor je lesplan
permalink: /les-samenstellen/oefeningen/index.html
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<div class="lesson-builder exercise-catalogue">
  <p class="lesson-builder-hint">
    Deze lijst wordt automatisch gegenereerd uit de oefenfiches. Gebruik ze als inspiratie in de
    <a href="/les-samenstellen/">lesplanner</a>, of deel de link met een AI.
    Er zijn <strong>{{ oefeningen.count }}</strong> oefeningen beschikbaar.
  </p>
  <p class="lesson-builder-hint">
    Handige links:
    <a href="/les-samenstellen/ai/">AI-instructies</a> ·
    <a href="/les-samenstellen/ai/oefeningen.md">Tekstversie voor AI</a> ·
    <a href="/scripts/data/vdc-oefeningen.jsonld">Volledig oefeningenbestand</a>
  </p>

  <div class="lesson-builder-grid">
    <section class="lesson-builder-panel">
      <div class="lesson-builder-panel-head">
        <h3>Beschikbaar clubmateriaal</h3>
        <span class="lesson-builder-count">{{ oefeningen.materials.length }} materialen</span>
      </div>
      <p class="lesson-builder-hint">Dit materiaal is beschikbaar tijdens de vrijdagtrainingen.</p>
      <ul class="lesson-builder-material-list">
        {% for material in oefeningen.materials %}<li>{{ material.label }}</li>{% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </section>
    {% for group in oefeningen.groups %}
    <section class="lesson-builder-panel">
      <div class="lesson-builder-panel-head">
        <h3>{{ group.label }}</h3>
        <span class="lesson-builder-count">{{ group.items.length }} oefeningen</span>
      </div>
      <div class="lesson-builder-list">
        {% for exercise in group.items %}
        <article class="lesson-builder-card" id="{{ exercise.slug }}">
          <h4>{{ exercise.name }}</h4>
          {% if exercise.description %}<p>{{ exercise.description }}</p>{% endif %}
          <p class="lesson-builder-meta">
            <span><strong>Duur:</strong> {{ exercise.durationMinutes }} min</span>
            <span><strong>Niveau:</strong> {{ exercise.levelLabel }}</span>
            {% if exercise.repetitions %}<span><strong>Herhaling:</strong> {{ exercise.repetitions }}</span>{% endif %}
            <span><strong>Kandidaten:</strong> min {{ exercise.minCandidates }}{% if exercise.maxCandidates %}, max {{ exercise.maxCandidates }}{% endif %}</span>
          </p>
          {% if exercise.teaches.length > 0 %}
          <p class="lesson-builder-meta">
            <span><strong>Leerdoel:</strong> {{ exercise.teaches | join(", ") }}</span>
          </p>
          {% endif %}
          {% if exercise.materials.length > 0 %}
          <div class="lesson-builder-bom">
            <strong>Materiaal</strong>
            <ul>
              {% for material in exercise.materials %}<li>{{ material }}</li>{% endfor %}
            </ul>
          </div>
          {% endif %}
          {% if exercise.steps.length > 0 %}
          <details class="lesson-builder-details">
            <summary>Uitgevoerd stappenplan</summary>
            <ol>
              {% for step in exercise.steps %}<li>{{ step }}</li>{% endfor %}
            </ol>
          </details>
          {% endif %}
        </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>
